      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOP SHELF TED (6) is a 25 start maiden who has placed eight times, the latest finishing in the minor money again when third at Q Lakeside. Although yet to win tends to go well here. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Expected to feature in the finish again. TUNGSTEN (1) turned in a moderate effort last time when eighth at this track over 300m behind Slippery Unicorn (17.91) in a Maiden. Placed at her previous run. Great chance to atone. GOLDSTAR DAPHNE (2) last start finished 4th on September 2 over 352m at Q Lakeside behind Jakari Britt beaten 8 lengths (21.08) in a PM. Looks suited here and can measure up. MANGO BEACH (7) cannot be underestimated.",
